  "name": "Mexican Oxtail Beef Soup",
  "subtitle": "Slow-simmered beef soup with corn, vegetables, lentils, and rice",
  "description": "A hearty Mexican-style soup combining browned beef, tender vegetables, lentils, rice, cabbage, and corn, served with warm tortillas.",
